Package: hokku-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 python3-flask,
 dnsmasq,
 network-manager
Description: First-boot setup wizard for Hokku appliance images
 Starts an open WiFi access point ("Hokku Setup") on first boot and serves
 a captive-portal setup page at 192.168.11.1. The user connects from their
 phone and configures WiFi, hostname, SSH, Samba, and mDNS. After setup the
 service disables itself and hokku-server takes over.
